<section class="border-b border-border bg-card"><div class="container-page py-14 sm:py-20"><div class="mb-8"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-muted-foreground"><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-current="page" class="text-foreground">FAQ</span></li></ol></nav></div><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Support</p><h1 class="max-w-4xl text-4xl leading-[1.08] sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">Frequently asked questions</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Everything owners, clinicians and facilities ask us before getting started. If your question is not answered here, our team replies to enquiries within one working day.</p></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr]"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>General</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">About the platform</h2></div><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card"><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">What exactly does PawlogicTech do?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">We build AI-driven pet care systems across five areas: health monitoring, behaviour analysis, training, smart daily care and safety. Sensors gather objective data about your animal, our models compare it against that animal's own baseline, and you receive clear, graded guidance about what needs attention.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Is this a replacement for veterinary care?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">No. PawlogicTech is a monitoring, triage and management platform. It surfaces evidence earlier and structures it for clinical review, but diagnosis and treatment are always the responsibility of a qualified veterinary professional.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Which animals are supported?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Dogs and cats from 2.5kg upwards are fully supported today. Support for rabbits and other small companion animals is in development with our veterinary advisory panel.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">How long before the system is useful?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Setup takes under thirty minutes. A fourteen-day baseline calibration follows, after which anomaly detection becomes accurate. Behavioural trigger correlation typically needs two to three weeks of observation.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">What happens to my data?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">It is encrypted in transit and at rest, stored under your account, and fully exportable or deletable at any time. We do not sell data to insurers, advertisers or data brokers. Household audio is classified on-device and never transmitted.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Do the devices work without internet?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Core functions continue offline. Feeding schedules, geofence alerts within range of your home hub and local data logging all operate normally, syncing once connectivity returns. Remote control and cellular tracking require a connection.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Do you use aversive training methods or hardware?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Never. We do not manufacture, sell or integrate with shock, prong, spray or vibration correction devices, and our training programmes are exclusively reward-based.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">How do I get started?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Book a consultation through our contact page. We will discuss your animals, your household and your goals, then recommend the smallest configuration that actually solves your problem rather than the largest one we can sell.</p></details></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-card"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr]"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Service</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">AI Pet Health Monitoring</h2></div><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card"><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Does AI pet health monitoring replace my veterinarian?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">No, and it is not designed to. PawlogicTech is a monitoring and triage tool. It surfaces objective evidence earlier so that your veterinarian can diagnose and treat sooner. Every alert directs you to professional care when clinically appropriate.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">How accurate are the alerts?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Accuracy depends on baseline quality. After a complete 14-day calibration our resting heart rate and respiration readings track clinical measurements closely, and severity grading is tuned to minimise false alarms rather than maximise alert volume.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Will my pet tolerate wearing the device?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The collar module weighs less than a standard ID tag and is rated for dogs and cats above 2.5kg. Most animals stop noticing it within a day.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">What happens to my data?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">It is encrypted, stored under your account, and exportable or deletable at any time. We do not sell data to insurers, advertisers or brokers.</p></details></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr]"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Service</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">AI Behavior Analysis</h2></div><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card"><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Is my home audio being recorded and stored?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">No. Audio is processed on the device itself and discarded immediately. Only classified event labels, such as 'distress vocalisation, 4 minutes', are transmitted. Human speech is never stored or transmitted.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Can this replace a qualified behaviourist?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">For mild cases it is often sufficient on its own. For aggression, severe anxiety or bite history you need a certified behaviourist, and our data makes their work substantially more effective.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">How quickly will I see change?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Trigger identification usually takes two to three weeks. Meaningful behavioural change from a well-targeted programme typically appears between weeks four and twelve.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Does it distinguish pain from misbehaviour?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">It screens for it. Sudden reactivity, night restlessness and posture change are classic pain presentations, and when that pattern appears we recommend veterinary assessment before any training programme.</p></details></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-card"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr]"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Service</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">AI Pet Training</h2></div><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card"><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Does PawlogicTech use any aversive methods?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">No. The platform is exclusively reward-based. We do not support or integrate with shock, prong, spray or vibration correction devices, and we will not generate programmes that rely on aversive techniques.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">How much time does it take each day?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Three to five sessions of two to five minutes each. Short and frequent consistently outperforms one long daily session, and the scheduler is built around that finding.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Can it train a cat?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. Cats train well with reward-based shaping. The feline curriculum focuses on carrier acceptance, cooperative care, recall and enrichment.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">What if progress stalls?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The system detects plateaus automatically and lowers criteria to rebuild success rate before progressing again, which is exactly the correction most owners miss.</p></details></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr]"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Service</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Smart Pet Care</h2></div><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card"><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">What happens during a power cut?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Feeders hold a battery reserve sufficient for at least two scheduled meals and retain their schedule. You receive an immediate outage notification, and dispensing resumes automatically on restoration.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Can it stop one pet eating another's food?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. Per-pet identification using RFID tags and weight signature means a bowl only opens for the animal it belongs to.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Does it work with wet food?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Our chilled feeder handles wet and raw portions for up to 48 hours. The standard dispenser is dry-food only.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Is an internet connection required?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Schedules run locally and continue during an outage. Connectivity is needed for remote control, alerts and data sync.</p></details></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-card"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr]"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Service</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">AI Pet Safety</h2></div><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card"><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">How accurate is the location tracking?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Typically three to five metres outdoors with clear sky. In dense urban environments or indoors, accuracy is maintained to roughly ten to fifteen metres using assisted positioning.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">What is the battery life?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Around fourteen days in standard monitoring. In active tracking mode during a recovery, expect approximately eighteen hours of continuous high-frequency reporting.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Does it work abroad?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. Multi-network roaming is included across most of Europe and North America with no additional configuration.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Is a subscription required?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Location services require a connectivity plan because the device uses cellular networks. Local features such as geofence alerts within range of your home hub continue regardless.</p></details></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-secondary"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Still stuck</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Ask us directly</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Email hello@pawlogictech.com or call +44 20 4526 8810. Monday to Friday, 09:00–18:00 GMT.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-primary px-8 py-16 text-primary-foreground sm:px-14"><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 -top-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-accent/25 blur-3xl"></span><div class="relative max-w-2xl"><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Start with a conversation, not a shopping cart</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75">Tell us about your animals and your household. We will recommend the smallest configuration that genuinely solves your problem.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-foreground transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/contact/' ) ); ?>">Book a consultation</a><a class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-primary-foreground/30 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition-colors hover:border-primary-foreground" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/' ) ); ?>">Explore services</a></div></div></div></div></section><script>(function(a,f){let l;try{l=JSON.parse(sessionStorage.getItem(a)||"{}")}catch{return}const n=l?.[f||history.state?.__TSR_key];let c=!1;for(const t in n){const e=n[t],o=e?.scrollX,s=e?.scrollY;if(Number.isFinite(o)&&Number.isFinite(s)){if(t==="window")scrollTo(o,s),c=!0;else if(t)try{const r=document.querySelector(t);r&&(r.scrollLeft=o,r.scrollTop=s)}catch{}}}if(c)return;const i=location.hash.slice(1);if(i){const t=history.state?.__hashScrollIntoViewOptions??!0;if(t){const e=document.getElementById(i);e&&e.scrollIntoView(t)}return}scrollTo(0,0)})("tsr-scroll-restoration-v1_3");document.currentScript.remove()</script>
